    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-GO--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-HELLO PIC X(64).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "GREETING" USING WS-HELLO
           MOVE WS-HELLO TO LBL-OUT::Caption
           DISPLAY "go".
]]></Event>
