    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-YIELD--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-I PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "spinning" TO LBL-OUT::Caption
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 3000000
               CONTINUE
           END-PERFORM
           MOVE "spun" TO LBL-OUT::Caption.
]]></Event>
