    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-TRAP--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TABLE.
           05 WS-CELL PIC 9 OCCURS 3 TIMES.
       01 WS-I PIC 9(4) VALUE 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "trapping" TO LBL-OUT::Caption
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CELL (WS-I).
]]></Event>
